<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>스포츠 뉴스 — 속보·이적·분석 | ARENA LIVE</title>
<meta name="description" content="축구·농구·야구 속보와 이적 소식, 전술 분석을 한 곳에서. ARENA LIVE 스포츠 뉴스 센터입니다.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://example.com/news">

<!-- Open Graph : 커뮤니티 공유 시 링크 미리보기 -->
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:title" content="스포츠 뉴스 — 속보·이적·분석 | ARENA LIVE">
<meta property="og:description" content="축구·농구·야구 속보와 이적 소식, 전술 분석을 한 곳에서. ARENA LIVE 스포츠 뉴스 센터입니다.">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://example.com/assets/img/news-main.jpg">
<meta property="og:locale" content="ko_KR">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#E85110">

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Montserrat:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;700&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Material+Symbols+Outlined:wght,FILL@100..700,0..1&display=swap">

<!-- Tailwind: 빌드된 CSS. 토큰은 assets/theme.js 에서 고치고 `npm run build:css` 로 다시 만든다 -->
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/tailwind.css">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/app.css">

<!-- 사이트 전체 정보. 경기·팀 정보는 실제 데이터가 온 뒤 assets/seo.js 가 붙인다.
     `example.com` 은 배포 위치가 정해지기 전의 자리표시자다 (BD 판단 항목).
     `SearchAction` 은 넣지 않는다 — 검색 결과 페이지를 만들지 않기로 했다(BD 결정). -->
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "WebSite",
  "name": "ARENA LIVE",
  "alternateName": "아레나 라이브",
  "url": "https://example.com/",
  "inLanguage": "ko-KR",
  "description": "실시간 스포츠 중계와 경기 일정·스코어를 한 곳에서 제공합니다."
}
</script>
</head>

<body class="bg-background text-on-surface font-body-md antialiased overflow-x-hidden flex min-h-screen">

<a class="skip-link" href="#main">본문으로 건너뛰기</a>
<div class="scrim md:hidden" id="scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<!-- ══════════════════ 사이드바 ══════════════════ -->
<aside id="sidebar" class="sidebar flex flex-col h-screen py-8 left-0 fixed border-r border-outline-variant bg-shadow-navy z-50 overflow-y-auto overflow-x-hidden"
       aria-label="종목 탐색">
  <div class="carbon-texture absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none"></div>

  <div class="px-6 mb-8 relative z-10 flex items-center gap-3">
    <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-surface-container-highest rounded-pill flex items-center justify-center shrink-0">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-shadow-navy" style="font-variation-settings:'FILL' 1" aria-hidden="true">dashboard</span>
    </div>
    <div class="sidebar-header-text whitespace-nowrap">
      <p class="font-headline-lg text-body-md font-bold text-on-primary">DASHBOARD</p>
      <p class="font-label-caps text-[10px] text-surface-variant/70">v4.2.0-STABLE</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="px-4 mb-8 relative z-10">
    <button type="button" class="sidebar-switch-btn w-full bg-primary-container hover:bg-primary-hover text-on-primary font-label-caps py-3 px-4 rounded shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] transition-colors flex justify-center items-center gap-2">
      <span class="sidebar-switch-text whitespace-nowrap">SWITCH MODE</span>
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined sidebar-switch-icon hidden" aria-hidden="true">swap_horiz</span>
    </button>
  </div>

  <nav class="flex-1 relative z-10 space-y-1">
    <a class="sidebar-link flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all group" href="schedule.html?sport=nba">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-hermes-orange shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">sports_basketball</span>
      <span class="sidebar-label font-label-caps text-surface-variant group-hover:text-hermes-orange whitespace-nowrap">NBA</span>
    </a>
    <a class="sidebar-link flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all group" href="schedule.html?sport=nfl">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-hermes-orange shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">sports_football</span>
      <span class="sidebar-label font-label-caps text-surface-variant group-hover:text-hermes-orange whitespace-nowrap">NFL</span>
    </a>
    <a class="sidebar-link flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all group" href="schedule.html?sport=premier-league">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-hermes-orange shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">sports_soccer</span>
      <span class="sidebar-label font-label-caps text-surface-variant group-hover:text-hermes-orange whitespace-nowrap">EPL</span>
    </a>
    <a class="sidebar-link flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all group" href="schedule.html?sport=mlb">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-hermes-orange shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">sports_baseball</span>
      <span class="sidebar-label font-label-caps text-surface-variant group-hover:text-hermes-orange whitespace-nowrap">MLB</span>
    </a>
    <a class="sidebar-link flex items-center gap-3 px-6 py-3 hover:bg-white/10 transition-all group" href="schedule.html?sport=f1">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-outline group-hover:text-hermes-orange shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">settings_input_antenna</span>
      <span class="sidebar-label font-label-caps text-surface-variant group-hover:text-hermes-orange whitespace-nowrap">F1</span>
    </a>
  </nav>

  <div class="px-6 mt-auto relative z-10 border-t border-surface-variant/20 pt-6 space-y-3">
    <p class="sidebar-status-container flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-emerald-400 text-sm shrink-0" style="font-variation-settings:'FILL' 1" aria-hidden="true">check_circle</span>
      <span class="sidebar-status-text font-label-caps text-[10px] text-surface-variant whitespace-nowrap">Status: Online</span>
    </p>
    <p class="sidebar-status-container flex items-center gap-2">
      <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-apex-blue text-sm shrink-0" aria-hidden="true">speed</span>
      <span class="sidebar-status-text font-label-caps text-[10px] text-surface-variant whitespace-nowrap">Latency: 24ms</span>
    </p>
  </div>
</aside>

<!-- ══════════════════ 본문 래퍼 ══════════════════ -->
<div class="main-wrap flex-1 flex flex-col md:pl-64 min-h-screen relative w-full">
  <div class="absolute inset-0 technical-grid pointer-events-none -z-10"></div>

  <!-- ── 상단 바 ── -->
  <header class="app-header w-full top-0 sticky bg-surface/90 backdrop-blur border-b-2 border-hermes-orange z-40">
    <div class="flex justify-between items-center px-margin-mobile md:px-gutter py-4 max-w-container-max mx-auto">

      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 lg:gap-6 xl:gap-10 min-w-0">
        <button type="button" id="sidebar-toggle" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="sidebar"
                class="cursor-pointer text-on-surface hover:text-hermes-orange transition-colors p-2 rounded-pill hover:bg-surface-container-highest shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined block" aria-hidden="true">menu</span>
          <span class="sr-only">메뉴 열기·닫기</span>
        </button>

        <a href="./index.html" class="font-display-lg text-[22px] sm:text-[26px] font-bold tracking-tighter text-on-surface flex items-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap shrink-0">
          ARENA <span class="font-medium text-hermes-orange">LIVE</span>
        </a>

        <!-- 🔴 브레이크포인트 주의: Tailwind의 lg/xl은 "화면 폭" 기준인데, 이 헤더가 쓰는
             실제 폭은 사이드바 256px을 뺀 값이다. 그래서 판단 기준을 한 단계씩 올려 잡는다.
             (예: 가용폭 1024px가 필요하면 xl=1280 이 아니라 2xl=1536에서 켠다)
             Command Center는 가장 길어 2xl에서만 노출하고, 그 아래에서는 사이드바로 접근한다. -->
        <nav class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-4 2xl:gap-8 overflow-hidden" aria-label="주 메뉴">
          <a class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase whitespace-nowrap" href="index.html">Home</a>
          <a class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase whitespace-nowrap" href="schedule.html">Schedule</a>
          <a class="text-on-surface-variant font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase whitespace-nowrap" href="match-center.html">Live</a>
          <a class="text-primary font-bold border-b-2 border-hermes-orange pb-1 font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase whitespace-nowrap" href="news.html" aria-current="page">News</a>
          <a class="hidden 2xl:inline text-on-surface-variant font-medium hover:text-primary transition-colors font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase whitespace-nowrap" href="dashboard.html">Command Center</a>
        </nav>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-center gap-1 sm:gap-2 xl:gap-4 shrink-0">
        <!-- 검색: xl에서 좁게, 2xl 이상에서 넉넉하게. 그 아래는 아이콘 버튼으로 대체 -->
        <form class="relative hidden xl:block" role="search" onsubmit="return false">
          <label class="sr-only" for="site-search">경기·팀 검색</label>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined absolute left-3 top-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 text-outline-variant text-sm" aria-hidden="true">search</span>
          <input id="site-search" type="search" placeholder="경기, 팀 검색…"
                 class="bg-surface-container pl-9 pr-3 py-2 rounded-pill text-sm font-body-sm border-none focus:ring-1 focus:ring-hermes-orange w-40 2xl:w-56 inset-panel">
        </form>
        <button type="button" class="xl:hidden text-outline hover:text-hermes-orange transition-colors p-2 shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">search</span>
          <span class="sr-only">검색</span>
        </button>

        <button type="button" class="bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label-caps px-4 py-2 rounded shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)] hover:bg-primary-hover transition-colors text-xs font-bold uppercase whitespace-nowrap shrink-0 hidden sm:block">GO PRO</button>

        <button type="button" class="text-outline hover:text-hermes-orange transition-colors p-2 shrink-0">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">notifications</span>
          <span class="sr-only">알림</span>
        </button>
        <button type="button" class="text-outline hover:text-hermes-orange transition-colors p-2 shrink-0 hidden 2xl:block">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined" aria-hidden="true">settings</span>
          <span class="sr-only">설정</span>
        </button>

        <div class="w-8 h-8 rounded-pill bg-surface-variant overflow-hidden border-2 border-outline-variant shrink-0">
          <img class="w-full h-full object-cover" src="assets/img/avatar.svg" alt="내 계정" width="32" height="32">
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <!-- ── 메인 ── -->
  <main id="main" class="flex-1 p-margin-mobile md:p-gutter w-full max-w-container-max mx-auto pb-section-gap">

    <header class="mt-stack-lg mb-stack-lg">
      <h1 class="font-headline-lg text-headline-lg-mobile md:text-headline-lg text-on-surface mb-2">스포츠 뉴스</h1>
      <p class="font-body-md text-on-surface-variant">속보부터 전술 분석까지, 오늘의 스포츠 소식입니다.</p>
    </header>

    <!-- 카테고리 -->
    <section class="mb-stack-lg" aria-labelledby="cat-title">
      <h2 id="cat-title" class="sr-only">카테고리</h2>
      <div class="flex overflow-x-auto gap-stack-md pb-3 snap-x no-scrollbar" role="tablist" aria-label="뉴스 카테고리">
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="true"  class="league-chip snap-start shrink-0 px-6 py-3 rounded-pill font-label-caps text-label-caps whitespace-nowrap transition-colors">전체</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="league-chip snap-start shrink-0 px-6 py-3 rounded-pill glass-card hover:border-hermes-orange text-on-surface font-label-caps text-label-caps whitespace-nowrap transition-colors">축구</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="league-chip snap-start shrink-0 px-6 py-3 rounded-pill glass-card hover:border-hermes-orange text-on-surface font-label-caps text-label-caps whitespace-nowrap transition-colors">농구</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="league-chip snap-start shrink-0 px-6 py-3 rounded-pill glass-card hover:border-hermes-orange text-on-surface font-label-caps text-label-caps whitespace-nowrap transition-colors">야구</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="league-chip snap-start shrink-0 px-6 py-3 rounded-pill glass-card hover:border-hermes-orange text-on-surface font-label-caps text-label-caps whitespace-nowrap transition-colors">이적</button>
        <button type="button" role="tab" aria-selected="false" class="league-chip snap-start shrink-0 px-6 py-3 rounded-pill glass-card hover:border-hermes-orange text-on-surface font-label-caps text-label-caps whitespace-nowrap transition-colors">분석</button>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- 헤드라인 -->
    <section class="depth-panel mb-section-gap" aria-labelledby="lead-title">
      <h2 id="lead-title" class="sr-only">헤드라인</h2>
      <article class="glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden group relative hover:border-hermes-orange transition-all grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2">
        <div class="aspect-video lg:aspect-auto lg:min-h-[320px] overflow-hidden relative">
          <img class="object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" src="assets/img/news-main.jpg" alt="야간 조명이 켜진 축구 경기장 전경" width="1200" height="675">
          <span class="absolute top-4 left-4 bg-primary-container text-on-primary font-label-caps text-label-caps px-3 py-1 rounded shadow-[inset_0_1px_0_rgba(255,255,255,0.2)]">BREAKING</span>
        </div>
        <div class="p-gutter lg:p-stack-lg flex flex-col justify-center">
          <p class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 font-label-caps text-label-caps uppercase">
            <span class="text-primary">축구</span>
            <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-pill bg-secondary-fixed-dim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
            <time class="text-secondary" datetime="2026-08-18T15:00+09:00">2시간 전</time></p>
          <h3 class="font-headline-md text-headline-md font-bold text-on-surface mb-3">
            <a class="group-hover:text-hermes-orange transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-0" href="#">사무국, 다음 시즌 대회 방식 전면 개편 발표</a></h3>
          <p class="font-body-lg text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-3">경쟁 구도와 팬 참여를 높이기 위한 조치로, 포스트시즌 구조를 대폭 손질하는 안이 승인됐다. 참가 팀 수와 일정에도 변화가 예상된다.</p>
        </div>
      </article>
    </section>

    <!-- 기사 목록 + 사이드 -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 xl:grid-cols-12 gap-stack-lg">
      <section class="depth-panel xl:col-span-8 min-w-0" aria-labelledby="list-title">
        <h2 id="list-title" class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-stack-md">최신 기사</h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-stack-lg">
        <article class="glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-hermes-orange transition-all group relative flex flex-col">
          <div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden shrink-0">
            <img class="object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy"
                 src="assets/img/news-1.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="225">
          </div>
          <div class="p-gutter flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 font-label-caps text-[10px] uppercase">
              <span class="text-primary">NBA</span>
              <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-pill bg-secondary-fixed-dim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="text-secondary">4시간 전</span></p>
            <h3 class="font-body-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">
              <a class="group-hover:text-primary transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-0" href="#">주전 포인트가드, 발목 부상으로 4~6주 결장</a></h3>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-2">3쿼터 착지 과정에서 발목이 꺾였다. 팀은 플레이오프 경쟁 구도에 타격을 입게 됐다.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-hermes-orange transition-all group relative flex flex-col">
          <div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden shrink-0">
            <img class="object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy"
                 src="assets/img/news-2.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="225">
          </div>
          <div class="p-gutter flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 font-label-caps text-[10px] uppercase">
              <span class="text-primary">테니스</span>
              <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-pill bg-secondary-fixed-dim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="text-secondary">6시간 전</span></p>
            <h3 class="font-body-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">
              <a class="group-hover:text-primary transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-0" href="#">최대 이변: 무시드 신인이 세계 1위를 꺾다</a></h3>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-2">5세트 접전 끝에 승부가 갈렸다. 대회 사상 최대 이변으로 기록될 전망이다.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-hermes-orange transition-all group relative flex flex-col">
          <div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden shrink-0">
            <img class="object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy"
                 src="assets/img/news-3.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="225">
          </div>
          <div class="p-gutter flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 font-label-caps text-[10px] uppercase">
              <span class="text-primary">분석</span>
              <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-pill bg-secondary-fixed-dim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="text-secondary">1일 전</span></p>
            <h3 class="font-body-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">
              <a class="group-hover:text-primary transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-0" href="#">전술 분석: 새 미드필드 3인이 바꾼 경기 양상</a></h3>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-2">중원 구성을 바꾼 뒤 전방 압박 성공률이 크게 올랐다. 데이터로 확인해 본다.</p>
          </div>
        </article>
        <article class="glass-card rounded-xl overflow-hidden hover:border-hermes-orange transition-all group relative flex flex-col">
          <div class="aspect-video overflow-hidden shrink-0">
            <img class="object-cover w-full h-full group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-500" loading="lazy"
                 src="assets/img/news-main.jpg" alt="" width="400" height="225">
          </div>
          <div class="p-gutter flex-1 flex flex-col">
            <p class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-3 font-label-caps text-[10px] uppercase">
              <span class="text-primary">이적</span>
              <span class="w-1 h-1 rounded-pill bg-secondary-fixed-dim" aria-hidden="true"></span>
              <span class="text-secondary">1일 전</span></p>
            <h3 class="font-body-lg font-semibold text-on-surface mb-2">
              <a class="group-hover:text-primary transition-colors after:absolute after:inset-0" href="#">겨울 이적시장 개막 D-60, 주요 구단 움직임</a></h3>
            <p class="font-body-sm text-on-surface-variant line-clamp-2">복수 구단이 미드필더 보강을 준비 중이다. 이적료 규모도 함께 짚어본다.</p>
          </div>
        </article></div>
      </section>

      <aside class="depth-panel xl:col-span-4 min-w-0" aria-labelledby="pop-title">
        <h2 id="pop-title" class="font-headline-md text-headline-md text-on-surface mb-stack-md">많이 본 기사</h2>
        <ol class="glass-card rounded-xl px-gutter py-2 mb-stack-lg">
          <li class="flex items-start gap-3 py-4 border-b border-outline-variant/40 last:border-b-0 group">
